  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #5897, eff 9-19-94, EXPIRED 9-19-00 New. #7399, eff 11-2-00, EXPIRED: 11-2-08 New. #9324, eff 11-21-08 (from He-W 543.04); ss by #12103, eff 2-9-17; ss by #14384, eff 9-20-25 (formerly He-W 543.05), EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
